  "vfx": {
    "Piece": {
      "Note": "pieces/witch_broom_aura: two Neon magic ribbons (purple, emerald) spiralling round the handle in opposite senses, turning like a screw, each with a Glow wave; the purple one hides under Lower effects. The body (pieces/witch_broom) carries the crystal Glow, the bristles flex and the hat charm Sway."
    },
    "Moving": {
      "Note": "The ribbons (the aura piece), the two orbiters and the halo beam pulse; the crystal core glows 0.2-0.7 over 2.4 s; the charm swings over 1.8 s; the bristles flex over 2.6 and 4 s."
    },
    "Aura": {
      "Note": "Secret (brief 2.4), inside out: a deep violet haze body (LightEmission 0.15, so it reads on the bright floor and under Night), a violet additive glow, emerald wisps rising, violet motes, gold star glints and anamorphic glints, crescent-moon flecks, straw leaves flying off the head, bats drifting up a few at a time (front-view flap flipbook, never mirrored), a sparkle trickle from the hat charm; one violet halo beam; a violet PointLight at the crystal and an emerald one at the binding; two sparkle heads riding the cue (gold and emerald); violet outline. About 97 particles a second before BackRateScale (budget 170).",
